      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i1: To start the process, I was feeling really stressed and then I made the decision to go on vacation."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening unit signals the process start and describes both the stress state and the vacation decision action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i2: If I decided yes, then I would choose the travel method."
      ],
      "justification": "The conditional introduces the XOR split, guards the positive arm with 'Yes', and executes the travel method selection."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i3: However, if I decided no, then I would resign from my job."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the negative guard condition ('No') and the resulting resignation action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "end:e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i4: Once I resigned from my job, the process would come to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Explicitly marks the termination point following the resignation path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n7",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i5: If I chose the plane as my travel method, then I would proceed with booking the tickets."
      ],
      "justification": "Introduces the second XOR split, guards the plane route, and executes ticket booking."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n9",
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i6: On the other hand, if I chose the car, then I would book a hotel."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the alternative guard condition ('Car') and the hotel booking action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i7: After booking the tickets, they would be successfully booked."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully captures the confirmation step for ticket booking."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i8: Similarly, after booking the hotel, it would be successfully booked as well."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully captures the confirmation step for hotel booking."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i9: Once the luggage was packed, I would take it to the car."
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit convergence of the two booking paths precedes the packing and transport actions described in this unit."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "end:e2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i10: Finally, when the luggage was taken to the car, the process would come to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Explicitly marks the final termination point of the main process flow."
    }
